### Variables (extensión REST Client de VS Code)
@base = http://localhost:3000/api
@usuario = acastro
@password = Sistep2026!

### 1) Login: ejecuta esta petición primero
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usuario": "{{usuario}}", "password": "{{password}}", "recordar": true }

### 2) Token devuelto por el login (se usa en todas las peticiones)
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
###
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Salud (pública, sin token)
GET {{base}}/health

### Dashboard
GET {{base}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
###
PATCH {{base}}/dashboard/alertas/HU-03
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Resuelto" }
###
DELETE {{base}}/dashboard/alertas/HU-03
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bandeja de alertas
GET {{base}}/alertas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
###
POST {{base}}/alertas/AL-021/notificar-pnp
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
###
DELETE {{base}}/alertas/AL-020
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Incidentes
GET {{base}}/incidentes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reportes
GET {{base}}/reportes?rango=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Configuración
GET {{base}}/configuracion
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
###
PUT {{base}}/configuracion
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "confidence": 85, "detectForce": true, "detectWeapons": true, "detectObjects": false,
  "activeModel": "v1.8.0-prod", "notifyPnp": true, "soundAlarm": false, "pnpContact": "105",
  "cameras": [ { "bus": "BUS-302", "model": "Cámara v3", "active": true },
               { "bus": "BUS-118", "model": "Cámara v2", "active": true } ] }

### Puente con la IA (HU-01): un forcejeo aparece luego en GET /alertas
POST {{base}}/eventos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bus_id": "BUS-302", "velocidad_movimiento": 95, "acercamiento_brusco": 1, "latitud": -12.0911, "longitud": -77.023 }
